 Plasmid ──→ DNA_Sequence (1:1)
   │            ↓ contains
   │          Feature[*]
   │
   └──→ NGS_QCRun (1:many)
          ↓ contains
        QCResult[*]  (Serotype | Recombination | CountSpacers | PLSA)

 Gene ←── (many) ── Plasmid (encodes)
   │
   ├── Pathway (many-to-many through gene_ids)
   ├── Intervention (one gene can have many interventions)
   ├── Aging Evidence (embedded in Gene, sourced from Open Genes)
   │
 Biomarker ──→ Gene (many-to-many)
   └── Cohort (many biomarkers per cohort, many cohorts per biomarker)

 SystematicReview ──→ Study[*]
   └── optionally links to Intervention / Gene
